# The 8-way terrain scroller: off the carrier, flying flat out (2.5 px a frame)
# east, then north, then south-west: the terrain above the gunship moves the
# other way, smoothly, across tile columns, tile rows and the ring's wrap.
# Classic steering: left/right turn (a step every 4 frames), up thrusts.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait 10
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
wait 10
hold up
wait 90
expect-scroll 0 0 319 70 140 -5/2 0
release
press left 13
hold up
wait 90
expect-scroll 0 0 319 70 140 0 5/2
release
press left 21
hold up
wait 90
expect-scroll 0 0 319 70 140 7/4 -7/4
screenshot southwest
release
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR"
